{"id": "DdyX6qCDHY_", "title": "Video by kahiyo.in", "description": "बंद दरवाज़ा · एपिसोड 1 — \"मीरा कहाँ है?\"\n\n56 दिन। एक बंद फ़्रीज़र। और एक पति जो हर रात उससे बात करता है — \"गुड नाइट, मीरा।\"\nदशहरे पर मीरा ने अपने भाई से कहा था — \"दादा, दीवाली पे आ रही हूँ… हमेशा के लिए।\"\nवो कभी नहीं पहुँची।\n\n—\nएक सच्ची घटना से प्रेरित काल्पनिक कहानी। नाम, किरदार और घटनाएँ बदले गए हैं।\n#बंददरवाज़ा #Kahiyo #truecrime #thriller #suspense #हिंदीकहानी", "channel": "kahiyo.in", "uploader_id": "32047977584", "uploader": "Kahiyo", "timestamp": 1790504200, "like_count": 28, "comment_count": 1, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-18107130635065585a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 72.279, "asr": 48000, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr22-1.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQPAnZYAIL6EDw4rm5xPK61KiFhUG5p60-lN_wvN5NYHqbVGPwYMTNcrKtf6Y6nQNTGxu0z7zPErvXdqJE2s5OwvVDUBLTh8AD4zyK4.mp4?_nc_cat=108&_nc_oc=AdqD_1FeiUqoZX5wzqS-D13V1VC6O0950rtnUrmpEjLQ9_xYuk-Kib0wHiepWTsTNDnLx5WlxlYdgxCB6ofEOJGD&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr22-1.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=yNl2NvMVhmcQ7kNvwERoEPG&&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=ApLLNzalQ9ou5arE_PYF9g&_nc_ss=70689&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQQi2eYD93BsW8vMkBa3R3_Aea7Ps2Kfpd22L7Y9eT_VTQ&oe=6AF40F1D", "manifest_stream_number": 0, "is_dash_periods": true, "protocol": "https", "audio_ext": "m4a", "video_ext": "none", "vbr": 0, "abr": 72.279, "resolution": "audio only", "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/150.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate", "Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "format": "dash-18107130635065585a - audio only (DASH audio)"}, {"url": "https://instagram.fblr22-1.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m86/AQOod